    "GroupSerial" : 25810,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen—\r\nCan we have a quick talk?\r\nIt's about this country.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様――\r\n少し、雑談でもいかがでしょうか\r\nこの国に関するお話です"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629389,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Throughout Acre Selund,\r\nthere are underground passages where those\r\nconnected to the royal family or who dedicated\r\ntheir lives to it are enshrined as spirits.",
        "Jp" : "アッカーシェラン各地には\r\n王家ゆかりの者や、王家にその人生を捧げた者が\r\n英霊として祀られる地下道があるのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629390,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The tale of spirits reviving to lend\r\ntheir power when the royal family faces\r\ncrisis is known by all in this land.",
        "Jp" : "英霊たちは王家に危機が迫った時\r\nよみがえってその力を\r\n貸してくれるというおとぎ話は、\r\nこの国の者なら誰もが知っているところ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629391,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Of course, it's just a fairy tale--\r\nNo one truly believes it.",
        "Jp" : "もちろん、それはおとぎ話――\r\n本気で信じている者はいないでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629392,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But why were such places built?\r\nMy theory is that the Epitaph Road\r\nare locations where particularly strong\r\ndragon energy flows in each region.",
        "Jp" : "しかし、なぜ各地にそのような場が設えられたか\r\n私の予想では、《英霊眠りし道》とは\r\nそれぞれの土地にある、特に強い竜力が\r\n流れる場所なのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651678,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now devoid of worshippers, barely\r\nguarded by sentinels at their entrance...\r\nBut, if claimed by you, Ser Arisen, \r\nthat slumbering power could surely bring\r\nbetter times for all.",
        "Jp" : "いまや参拝する者もおらず、かろうじて\r\n番人がその入口を守るのみとなっていますが――\r\nあの場に眠る力を覚者様のものとできれば\r\nきっと、さらに状況はよくなるはず"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651679,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, could you head to\r\n<STG 1140> and investigate the truth?\r\nThe local guards should know something\r\nabout the inside.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、《<STG 1140>》へ向かい\r\n真相を調査してきていただけないでしょうか\r\nきっと、現地の番人であれば内部のことを\r\nいくらかは知っているはずです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651680,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2852,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Ilva",
      "Jp" : "イルヴァ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 25811,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you can claim the power sleeping there,\r\nthings will surely improve.\r\nHead to <STG 1140> and\r\nlisten to the local guards.",
        "Jp" : "あの場に眠る力を覚者様のものとできれば\r\nきっと、さらに状況はよくなるはず\r\n<STG 1140>に向かい\r\n現地の番人の話を聞いてみてください"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629393,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
