    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2852,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Ilva",
      "Jp" : "イルヴァ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 25812,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Huh? About the Epitaph Road?\r\n... It might sound strange coming from me\r\nsince I'm entrusted with guarding it,\r\nbut it's practically a fairy tale.",
        "Jp" : "え？　《英霊眠りし道》についてですか？\r\n――こうして守備を任されている自分が言うのも\r\nおかしな話ですが、半ばおとぎ話ですよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629394,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well… When the royal family faces a crisis,\r\nthe heroic spirits enshrined here lend\r\ntheir power. There's no chance of that happening.",
        "Jp" : "ええっと――王家に危機が訪れた時\r\nここに祀られた英霊たちが\r\n力を貸してくれるってやつです\r\nまぁ、ありえませんよね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651671,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "... I've also heard legends that speak of\r\ngreat draconic power slumbering here,\r\ngranted by the royal family's wisdom.",
        "Jp" : "――あと、王家の叡智によって\r\nここに強力な竜力が眠っているとかいう話も\r\n聞いたことがありますね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651672,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To release that power, you must\r\novercome the \"Trial of the Cursed Tablet\"\r\nand place your hand on \r\nthe \"Spirit Heroes Statue\" deep inside.",
        "Jp" : "その力を解放するには\r\n\"呪印刻まれし石版の試練\"を乗り越え\r\n奥にある\"英霊の石像\"に触れないといけないとか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629395,
      "MsgType" : 1,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 25813,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What is the Trial of the Tablet?",
        "Jp" : "石版の試練とは？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629396,
      "MsgType" : 2,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 25814,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What is the Spirit Heroes Statue?",
        "Jp" : "英霊の石像とは？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629397,
      "MsgType" : 2,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 606,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Pehr",
      "Jp" : "ペール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 25813,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Trial of the Tablet...\r\nIt's said to be a trial prepared\r\nby our ancestors to protect this land.",
        "Jp" : "石版の試練は――\r\nこの地を守るために\r\n先人たちが用意した試練って話ですよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629398,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You must touch the cursed stone\r\nand defeat the Trial Enemies,\r\nwhich house the ancestors' souls--",
        "Jp" : "呪印のある石版に触れて\r\n先人たちの霊魂が宿る\r\n\"試練の敵\"に打ち勝つ必要があって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629399,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you overcome the trial,\r\nyou can receive the blessings\r\nof the spirits' protection.",
        "Jp" : "その試練に打ち勝てば\r\n英霊たちが守る恩恵に与ることが\r\nできるんだそうです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629400,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, it's a common tale.\r\nIt was built long ago, and the depths\r\nare buried in debris, so\r\nexploring would be difficult.",
        "Jp" : "まぁ、よくある話ですよね\r\n何せ昔に造られたもので、奥は\r\n土砂に埋まってますから\r\n探索するにしても難しいと思います"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651681,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, but Ser Arisen, you're free\r\nto explore inside! I'm sure\r\neveryone in this country agrees.",
        "Jp" : "あ、覚者さまなら\r\n自由に中を見学してくださっても大丈夫ですよ！\r\nきっとこの国の者全員がそう思っているはずです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651682,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 606,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Pehr",
      "Jp" : "ペール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 25814,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hmm, let me see...\r\nAh yes, by touching the Spirit Heroes Statue\r\nenshrined in the deepest part of the chamber...",
        "Jp" : "うーんと――\r\nそうそう、英霊の間の最奥に安置された\r\n英霊の石像に触れる事で――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629401,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's said that a spot where one can encounter the \r\nmighty Dragon Force, slumbering in this land, \r\nwill be unlocked. \r\nBut it can only be accessed at certain times.",
        "Jp" : "限られた時にしか入ることができない、\r\nこの地に眠る強力な竜力に\r\nまみえることができる\r\nスポットが解放されるのだとか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629402,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They say it's far stronger than Blood Orbs. \r\nPerhaps one might call it a \"High Orb\"?",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、ブラッドオーブよりも\r\nはるかに強力な竜力なんだそうですよ\r\n《ハイオーブ》ってところですかね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 629403,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master Arisen, you may take a look inside if you\r\nwish. But just to be clear, I truly don't know if\r\nsuch a thing really exists.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さまなら、中を見学してくださっても\r\n大丈夫ですが――\r\n念のために言っておきますけど\r\n本当にそんなものがあるかはわかりませんよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 651683,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 606,
    "NpcName" : {
